@startuml
title SD01 - Calculate order discounts (UC05 / AD05 / AD28)
autonumber
actor "Sales employee" as Sales
participant "order:Order" as O
participant "customer:Customer" as C
participant "discount:CustomerDiscount" as D
Sales -> O: calculateTotalAmount()
activate O
O -> O: calculateOrderDiscount()
note right of O: 5% order discount when order subtotal >= EUR 500.
O -> C: calculateAnnualRevenue()
activate C
C --> O: previousYearRevenue
deactivate C
O -> D: determinePercentage(previousYearRevenue, currentYear)
activate D
D --> O: 5%, 10% or 15% customer discount
deactivate D
O -> O: calculateCustomerDiscount()
note right of O
  Apply the annual customer discount to the
  amount remaining after the order discount.
  AD28 saves the rate on December 31 for the next year.
end note
alt First order and customer.oneTimeDiscountGranted and not order.oneTimeDiscountApplied
  O -> O: calculateOneTimeDiscount()
  note right of O: Extra 10% only when the acquisition incentive was granted (AD21).
else No acquisition incentive
  note right of O: No additional first-order discount.
end
O -> O: calculateTotalAmount()
O --> Sales: totalAmount and applied discounts
deactivate O
@enduml
